    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The Swedes were the first to recognize that public officials like civil servants, police officers, health inspectors or tax-collectors can make mistakes or act over-zealously in the belief that they are serving the public.",
      "translation": "瑞典人首先认识到，像公务员、警官、卫生监督员或税务人员这样的公职人员，在认为自己是在为公众服务的信念下，也可能会犯错或表现过火。",
      "startTime": 40.21,
      "endTime": 56.75,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "over-zealously",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "过分热情地"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "As long ago as 1809, the Swedish Parliament introduced a scheme to safeguard the interest of the individual.",
      "translation": "早在1809年，瑞典议会就引入了一项计划来保护个人的利益。",
      "startTime": 56.76,
      "endTime": 66.74,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "safeguard",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "保护"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "A parliamentary committee representing all political parties appoints a person who is suitably qualified to investigate private grievances against the State.",
      "translation": "一个代表所有政党的议会委员会委任一名具备适当资格的人选，来调查针对国家的个人投诉。",
      "startTime": 66.75,
      "endTime": 78.62,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "grievance",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "不满，委屈"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The official title of the person is 'Justiteombudsman', but the Swedes commonly refer to him as the 'J.O.' or 'Ombudsman'.",
      "translation": "该负责人的正式头衔是“司法监察官”，但瑞典人通常称之为“J.O.”或“民意调查员”。",
      "startTime": 78.63,
      "endTime": 89.5,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "ombudsman",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "民意调查员"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The Ombudsman is not subject to political pressure. He investigates complaints large and small that come to him from all levels of society.",
      "translation": "民意调查员不受政治压力影响。他调查来自社会各阶层的各种大小投诉。",
